	"Description": "Player-facing mode actions as abilities (M12 G2, game-modes 2.4): UGSTN_GA_ModeVerb is a predicted hold inside the Network Prediction simulation that ends in ONE authoritative, validated event outside the rollback (Message.Mode.Verb on the server event stream). Includes the requestable prop (an Interact.Target.Objective record armed by frame) and the verb subsystem that validates and republishes. GSTNModeVerbsCore is pure; GSTNModeVerbsNP needs the GAS-NPP fork.",
